 cut—whether through a system shutdown or a sudden power failure—the electrical charges representing the data dissipate, and the information is lost. This makes RAM an ephemeral workspace.\n\nIn contrast, an SSD is non-volatile. It utilizes NAND flash memory, which uses floating-gate transistors to trap electrons even when no power is supplied. This allows the SSD to act as a permanent repository. For example, when you save a Word document, the data", "generation_wall_seconds": 8.827595917042345, "benchmark": {"init_time_in_second": 49.228464708, "time_to_first_token_in_second": 3.10098391175, "last_prefill_token_count": 58, "last_prefill_tokens_per_second": 18.840122984983594, "last_decode_token_count": 256, "last_decode_tokens_per_second": 44.547904570734524}, "conversation_token_count": 314, "generation_completed": true, "conversation_closed": true}, {"index": 1, "events": [{"elapsed_seconds": 0.17730591597501189, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"#\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.19590983306989074, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Understanding\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.21489129099063575, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" the\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.23545212508179247, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Hierarchy\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.2544644579757005, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" of\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.2732689999975264, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Memory\"}]}", "is_final": false}, {"elapsed_seconds": 0.2938198749907315, "error": null, "message": "{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"co